--- !u!114 &762368376
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 762368374}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 29820fe86f0d5574aa04c22576dc2877, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EventManager
  mainMenu: {fileID: 1309224745}
  gameScene: {fileID: 808428394}
  storyPanel: {fileID: 1630365707}
  storyImage: {fileID: 296946031}
  storyText: {fileID: 425112881}
  storySlides:
  - image: {fileID: 1791930146750060049, guid: a366323f95082274297263bbf8b20fbb, type: 3}
    dialogue: Growing up, we never had much, but there was always food on the table.
  - image: {fileID: -4236170157349139157, guid: 1c2a7348471219640944a17e24e17f61, type: 3}
    dialogue: Every year on my birthday, Grandma would spend hours in the kitchen, determined to bake me the perfect cake.
  - image: {fileID: -4236170157349139157, guid: 1c2a7348471219640944a17e24e17f61, type: 3}
    dialogue: She taught me that cooking wasn't just about making something delicious. It was about making someone feel loved.
  - image: {fileID: -6526222578329485888, guid: 57d0ee1bf78c9204bacbc5e70378c738, type: 3}
    dialogue: And when Grandma got sick, it was finally my turn to take care of her. I cooked for her every day, just like she always had for me.
  - image: {fileID: -9047570751922010358, guid: 2bbff0dc6e6426347a6d53f2eafaea60, type: 3}
    dialogue: Ever since, I've dreamed of sharing that same love with the rest of the world.
  - image: {fileID: -9047570751922010358, guid: 2bbff0dc6e6426347a6d53f2eafaea60, type: 3}
    dialogue: 'And what better place to start than the world-famous... '
  - image: {fileID: -5266948620261686231, guid: 0410a059c1899ae4caf8874af9e4a7a4, type: 3}
    dialogue: 'Whiskconsin University!

'
  - image: {fileID: -5266948620261686231, guid: 0410a059c1899ae4caf8874af9e4a7a4, type: 3}
    dialogue: ...Okay, maybe not world-famous. But it's my dream school!
  - image: {fileID: -5266948620261686231, guid: 0410a059c1899ae4caf8874af9e4a7a4, type: 3}
    dialogue: There's just one problem...I'm flat broke.
  - image: {fileID: -897338434824067335, guid: 872f5fb8d21098f409d3fefaed174f51, type: 3}
    dialogue: But, I've got an idea!
